# useState with Input

```jsx
import React, { useState } from "react";

const App = () => {
  const [name, setName] = useState("");

  return (
    <div>
      <input
        type="text"
        value={name}
        onChange={(e) => setName(e.target.value)}
      />

      <h1>{name}</h1>
    </div>
  );
};

export default App;
```

Flow:

User Types
↓
onChange
↓
setName()
↓
State Updates
↓
UI Updates

