# useState with Array

```jsx
const [items, setItems] = useState([]);
```

Add item:

```jsx
setItems([...items, "Apple"]);
```

Add another:

```jsx
setItems([...items, "Mango"]);
```

Display:

```jsx
{
  items.map((item, index) => (
    <li key={index}>{item}</li>
  ));
}
```

